\subsection{Analysis of Static Scheduling Strategies for Emulator Threads in Co-location}

This section analyzes the impact of statically adjusting Emulator thread scheduling strategies on the performance of virtual machines in a co-location environment. Specifically, this section begins with a theoretical analysis of the total number of Emulator thread scheduling strategies available for hybrid-deployed virtual machines and then explores the influence of these strategies on virtual machine performance.

