To identify a subset of the dataset that can be beneficial for the model performance the most, we propose an approach that empowers the existing active learning framework (described in Section~\ref{sec:al}) for vulnerability detection by integrating the insights uncovered by dataset maps (described in Section~\ref{sec:dm}). 

