To cover the parameters' range, a total of 100 calculations are performed, with 8 covering the parameter limits and the remaining 92 selected using the Latin Hypercube method within the parameter ranges. Abaqus is utilized to execute these simulations. For each simulation, the displacement vector is extracted for every time increment and added to the snapshot database. Similarly, the load vector and the stiffness matrix are recorded. The reader is refered to appendix \ref{Abaqus} for more details on the technical implementation.\\

