\end{equation*}

Let $R>0$ be an arbitrary number. We assume that initial conditions in (\ref%
{2.4}) are such that 
\begin{equation}
\left( u_{0},m_{0}\right) \in H_{2,0}^{k_{n}}\left( \Omega \right)
,\left\Vert \left( u_{0},m_{0}\right) \right\Vert _{H_{2}^{k_{n}}\left(
