It follows from (\ref{7.11})-(\ref{7.13}) that the full analog of \cref{Theorem 5.1} is valid for the functional $I_{\lambda ,\alpha }\left( v,s\right) $ for
all $\lambda \geq \lambda _{2}.$ Let (\ref{2.00}) be valid. Choose a
sufficiently small number $\delta _{0}=\delta _{0}\left( M,3R,c,d,\gamma
,Q_{T}\right) \in \left( 0,1\right) $ depending only on listed parameters
such as 
\begin{equation}
