\section{Cross-correlation of Bj\"orck Sequences: \\Prime and Non-prime Length Sequences}\label{sec:cross_corr_bjorck}
In this section, we study the cross-correlation properties of Bj\"orck sequences, extending these sequences to non-prime lengths and proposing alternative approaches for non-prime length sequence generation with reduced cross-correlation. 
