\subsection{$p>3$}
In this subsection, we compute the differential spectrum of $x^d$ over $\mathbb{F}_{p^n}$ (for $p>3$) by employing methodology analogous to Lemma \ref{lemma ds s f2}, omitting repetitive proof details.
\begin{lemma}\label{lemma ds s f4}
Let $\alpha=\psi^{p^m-1}$ and $\frac{p^m+1}{t}>3$. Within the established notational framework, we derive:
\begin{itemize}
\item[(i)] $\delta(0)=t(p^m-1)-1$. 
\item[(ii)] $\delta(1)=\delta(p-1)=1$ for $6t\nmid p^m+1$. $\delta(1)=\delta(p-1)
     =2t^2+1$ for $6t\mid p^m+1$.
