\begin{lemma}\label{bs 3 lemma}
Let $\alpha=\psi^{3^m-1}$ and $\frac{3^m+1}{t}>3$. Employing the notation introduced earlier, we demonstrate that:
\begin{itemize}
\item[(i)] $\beta(1)=\beta(2)=0$
