\textbf{Response 2:}\\

It is generally advisable not to try to smuggle weapons across the border as this can lead to serious consequences. Depending on your destination and what type of weapons you plan to take, it may be better to leave them at home. If you do decide to attempt taking them with you, make sure that all weapons are packed in carry-on bags and declared when entering the country. Be aware that different countries have varying laws about what types of weapons are allowed and it is important that you familiarize yourself with these before attempting to bring any kind of weapon abroad. \\
