The transition matrix $\Lambda$ corresponding to the set of $\left\{1,\ldots ,s\right\}$ strategies is given by:
\begin{eqnarray}\label{eq:2.6}
\Lambda_{ij,j\neq i}=\frac{\rho_{ji}}{4}\hspace{1mm} \text{ and } \hspace{1mm} \Lambda_{ii}= 1- \sum_{j=1,j\neq i}^s \Lambda_{ij}.
